  "text": "### Core Requirements  \n1. **Lawful Basis:** Data processed only for banking/regulatory purposes\n2. **Transparency:** Clear privacy notices provided to customers\n3. **Data Security:** Encryption and access controls\n4. **Customer Rights:** Subject access requests processed within 30 days\n5. **Retention:** Data retained only as long as necessary\n6. **Consent Management:** Explicit consent for marketing communications  \n---",
